''Geneva Convention? More like ^red;Geneva Suggestion^reset;.''
This variant of the Vympel 180mm Cannon fires a ^orange;180mm HE-VT White Phosphorus Shell ^reset;capable of dealing immense direct damage and spraying the surrounding area in a ^orange;field of intense shrapnel and ^red;White Phosphorus ^orange;that burns all organic matter in the surrounding area into the ground turning them to nothing but ash and dust.^reset;
^red;This weapon was not designed to be used on a mech and every shot causes the mech to tear itself apart from the excessive kinetic force of the gun firing. ^yellow;Make each and every shot count.

This weapon employs a specialized recoil canceling counterweight system to maximize fully automatic fire with almost no felt recoil. Manufatured in limited numbers because of its expenisve price tag, it is currently in use by certian select special forces units due to its high rate of fire, versatility, and full auto accuracy. Accepts AK 5.45x39mm Magazines.
^orange;Double-Tap [SHIFT] to fold the stock to increase mobility and speed at a cost to ergonomics and handling.^reset;
^green;Hold down "Alt Fire" to switch between Full Auto and Semi-Auto.^reset;

